  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 ecbi= European Capacity Building Initiative. Utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder m&#xe5;ste f&#xe5; l&#xe5;ta sina r&#xf6;ster h&#xf6;ras i klimatf&#xf6;rhandlingarna.De m&#xe5;ste f&#xe5; tillg&#xe5;ng till vetenskapliga och juridiska r&#xe5;d och en plattform f&#xf6;r intern diskussion. &#xc5;r 2005 bildades ecbi f&#xf6;r att erbjuda en s&#xe5;dan plattform. Det inneh&#xe5;ller tre delar: a Fellowship Drogram, a Workshop Program och ett Policy Analys Program, som st&#xf6;ds av Sida i denna fas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing countries need to make their voices heard and safeguard their interests in climate change negotiations. Developing countries need better access to scientific and legal advice and a platform for internal discussions. In 2005, ecbi was launched to provide such a platform. Three programs: a Fellowship Drogram, a Workshop Program and a Policy Analysis Program. Sida support all three in this phase</narrative>
  </description>
